# game/data/characters/adara/dialogue.rpy:42
translate kr adara_talk_howareyou_666024d3:

    # ADARA @ smile "I am well, [player_name!t], thank you for asking."
    ADARA @ smile "잘 지내, [player_name!t], 물어봐줘서 고마워."

# game/data/characters/adara/dialogue.rpy:44
translate kr adara_talk_howareyou_7fe3643a:

    # ADARA @ talk "Did you hear about the commotion in the pleasure district? Some kind of ... {i}monster{/i} attacked one of the gangs, at least, that's the rumour."
    ADARA @ talk "환락가에서 있었던 소동 들었어? 어떤... {i}괴물{/i}이 갱단 하나를 습격했다더라, 적어도 그런 소문이야."

# game/data/characters/adara/dialogue.rpy:46
translate kr adara_talk_howareyou_0c7cccc7:

    # ADARA @ smile "I am well thank you! Have you seen that new market stall selling Ramonian food? It's very popular!"
    ADARA @ smile "잘 지내 고마워! 라모니아 음식 파는 새 시장 노점 봤어? 아주 인기 많더라!"

# game/data/characters/adara/dialogue.rpy:48
translate kr adara_talk_howareyou_003c1185:

    # ADARA @ smile "You're making quite a name for yourself, aren't you? Congratulations on moving up ranks in the adventurers guild!"
    ADARA @ smile "꽤 이름을 날리고 있구나, 그렇지? 모험가 길드에서 승급한 거 축하해!"

